# Canonical tip feed for the site billboard + /wallet (build-time for Vite).
# Omit → lab light (browser genesis). See docs/CANONICAL-TIP.md
# VITE_PIXEL_RPC=http://127.0.0.1:8545
#
# Production builds: refuse to present lab light as the public tip.
# Requires VITE_PIXEL_RPC to be set at build time.
# VITE_REQUIRE_PUBLIC_TIP=1
